Name Easter Tablet #8

Interactability_Text_Line_0 Here lies the site of the seal. If there is ever a need, the seal can be broken by gathering all 3 crystal bodies to this location.
Interactability_Text_Line_1 The soul of Hotu Matu'a, the oldest of them all, he sleeps in a chamber, far removed from everyone else, he can hear the ocean from his bed.
Interactability_Text_Line_2 The soul of Tu‘u ko Iho sleeps where things are lost, and from where he was given life.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 The soul of Miru, tamer of fire, was disturbed, it is unknown where it lies.